        <p>Welcome to the <a href="https://www.orcas-coastal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ORCAS Consulting</a> Marine Calculators web app. This page is intended to provide a collection of simple but generally well-established methods for exploring some of the fundamental processes that are often the focus of marine science investigations.</p>
        <p>These are not meant to be a complete set of tools. Rather, they provide a quick and simple means of feeling out the basics of marine science problems. At the beginning of a project, for example, you may want to know whether typical waves will be important for sediment transport at a given water depth and grain size, or what wave characteristics might develop in a closed water body during a strong wind event. The calculators are designed to help with these preliminary investigations and can also serve an educational purpose for people learning about fundamental physical oceanographic processes.</p>
